DESCRIPTION:Duration: 73 mins (1h13m)\n\nFor the first time\, blind and lo
 w-vision kids take control of the cameras and capture their own experience
 s at the annual Braille Challenge—a weekend of high-pressure competition
  and raw coming-of-age moments.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters
 /brailled-it\n\nEstimated start: 16:15
